### NEXT (noob)

`noob` is on. After this step, tell the user what to run next. **Do not**
auto-dispatch the suggestion unless this skill already chains that command
(`auto_plan` / `auto_build` / `auto_close` / yolo).

1. Run `issue-flow agent state --json`. Choose **Recommended** from this
   table (chat form `iflow <step>` also works). Do **not** blindly print
   `next_command` when there is no focus.

   - **Focus exists** → print `next_command` (plan / build / close).
   - **No focus** + `epic_hint.epics` non-empty + `epic_session` set →
     `/iflow` (one-and-ask). Put the first `next_candidates` number in
     the why line.
   - **No focus** + `epic_hint.epics` non-empty + no session →
     `/iflow-pick`.
   - **No focus** + `epic_session` set + empty `epic_hint.epics` → run
     `issue-flow agent epic-status <epic_session.epic> --json`. If the
     current stage has unpublished specs → `/iflow-epic <N> publish`.
     Else `/iflow-status`. Never `/iflow-capture`.
   - **Else** → `next_command` (usually `/iflow-capture`).

